888da07acbc2dcfd0ad3180.poster.avif?t=1758642268\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911680/extras/2913123c8888da07acbc2dcfd0ad3180.webm?t=1758642268\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911680/extras/2913123c8888da07acbc2dcfd0ad3180.mp4?t=1758642268\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">Begin a journey where every step is a test of intelligence, reflex, and imagination. A world lies ahead of you, full of puzzles \u2014 puzzles that challenge your logic and demand great attention. At the same time, platforming sections require precise timing and quick reactions as you jump, climb, and make your way through dangerous landscapes. Throughout it all, there is a <strong>unique electromagnetic mechanic</strong> that you can use to solve puzzles and progress through the game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p>","developers":["Nova Edge Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3911680/7c5d0398e9d3798f726eddcdf3fcfa972af69480/header.jpg?t=1758642268","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911680/1458543745/0589b4d7a5704c53c362d2a3ccdafb884d6f2bb6/1755574862/dash_av1.mpd?t=1758641371","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911680/1458543745/0589b4d7a5704c53c362d2a3ccdafb884d6f2bb6/1755574862/dash_h264.mpd?t=1758641371","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3911680/1458543745/0589b4d7a5704c53c362d2a3ccdafb884d6f2bb6/1755574862/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1758641371","id":257185222,"mp4":{"